  <h1>About Chakam</h1>
  <p class="updated">The story, and how to reach us.</p>

  <h2>What it is</h2>
  <p>Chakam reads a chat you already have — a WhatsApp or Telegram export, or screenshots from Instagram, Snapchat, Messenger, or iMessage — and turns it into a set of stats and cards: who texts first, who double-texts, reply speed, red flags, and a short AI-written verdict on the overall dynamic.</p>

  <h2>Why on-device first</h2>
  <p>Most of what Chakam shows you is computed directly on your phone. We built it this way on purpose: a chat analyzer that quietly uploads your entire conversation history somewhere is the opposite of what this app is supposed to be. See the <a href="/privacy/">Privacy Policy</a> for exactly what does and doesn't leave your device.</p>

  <h2>Who's behind it</h2>
  <p>Chakam is built and run by Kodeblooded, an independent app studio. We also build <a href="https://apps.apple.com/us/app/veyld-ask-me-anything/id6766130197">Veyld</a>, an anonymous Q&amp;A app.</p>

  <h2>Get in touch</h2>
  <p>Questions, feedback, or a bug to report: <a href="mailto:info@kodeblooded.com.ng">info@kodeblooded.com.ng</a>.</p>
